{"`queued` is set with `timezone.now()` at class definition time, so every `AssignmentSource` instance will share the same timestamp. Use a dataclass `field(default_factory=timezone.now)` so the timestamp is evaluated per instance.": 0.970283567905426, "Typo in test name: `inalid` -> `invalid`.": 0.3440810739994049, "`sync_status_outbound` is now declared with an `assignment_source` parameter, but status syncing doesn't pass/use this and many implementations (e.g., `ExampleIntegration.sync_status_outbound`) don't accept it. This increases the chance of a future runtime `TypeError` if callers start passing `assignment_source`. Consider removing this parameter here (or switching to `**kwargs: Any` only, as other abstract methods do).": 0.6871947050094604}